    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "1. <b>Game Brief</b>\n    * Use the 'Options' button to configure the
    dungeon size\n    * Find the key from each room and exit the dungeon floor via
    the portal\n\n2. <b>Player Controls</b>\n    Keyboard:\n    * Use keys W (up),
    A (left) S (down) and D (right) or arrow keys to move\n    * Hold down the Left-Shift
    key together with a direction key to run\n    * Hold fown the Right-Shift key 
    for first-person view\n    * Use the mouse movement to look around (cursor is
    invisible).\n    * M key to toggle visibility of map\n\n    Gamepad:\n    * Move
    - Left stick\n    * Run - Left trigger\n    * Look - Right stick\n    * First-person
    view - Left shoulder\n    * Toggle Map - Button west\n\n"
